# Beyond Infinity, Waughroon Shrine (battlefield.beyond_infinity_waughroon_shrine): main registers and invites bob
# (accepted, clasp), cat (accepted, no clasp), dan (completed, no clasp) and eve (available, no clasp). Only the
# registrant needs the clasp: bob, cat and dan enter, eve gets no options. Atori-Tutori killed: the win for the
# party, each finish.
lists WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrigger WaughroonShrine/onEventUpdate/32000 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32000 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75
